{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"buzz-finds-a-flower","version":1,"title":"Buzz Finds a Flower","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Buzz was a little bee. Zzz, zzz, zzz! She was hungry. She wanted something sweet.","sentences":["Buzz was a little bee.","Zzz, zzz, zzz!","She was hungry.","She wanted something sweet."],"alt":"A small striped bee flies in the morning sun.","image":{"hash":"sha256:f3019db075b36552f4e0b963bc4f23d486264353e44f5bcf4fcbcb9cf60fae71","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:6bd3c192e0d431b9b50c77216eb59cdac981818e7491f1bd9367c8926934eeb5","durationMs":13920,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3652],[3652,6436],[6436,9184],[9184,13920]],"words":[[0,723],[723,1265],[1265,1446],[1446,2531],[2531,3652],[3652,4483],[4483,5315],[5315,6436],[6436,6978],[6978,7520],[7520,9184],[9184,9726],[9726,10811],[10811,12438],[12438,13920]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Buzz flew over a hill. The hill was brown and bare. There were no flowers. Zzz, zzz.","sentences":["Buzz flew over a hill.","The hill was brown and bare.","There were no flowers.","Zzz, zzz."],"alt":"A bee flies over a bare brown hill.","image":{"hash":"sha256:08340df610bdbddb2423dc7d91065224b941d38668a33e4a7090fcefdf8eb965","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:198bdb55e06b57966ca1e3eed16bb6dc755f4ac7eaa890585976139398005883","durationMs":15720,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4103],[4103,9221],[9221,13527],[13527,15720]],"words":[[0,812],[812,1625],[1625,2437],[2437,2640],[2640,4103],[4103,4712],[4712,5524],[5524,6134],[6134,7149],[7149,7758],[7758,9221],[9221,10236],[10236,11049],[11049,11455],[11455,13527],[13527,14461],[14461,15720]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Buzz flew over a road. Honk, honk! A truck went by. There were no flowers here, too.","sentences":["Buzz flew over a road.","Honk, honk!","A truck went by.","There were no flowers here, too."],"alt":"A bee flies over a road with a truck.","image":{"hash":"sha256:e5db8f9d1313bfebd24b44a28172cbdd7efbbb093f2055b008c6dcac5bbd7e10","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:c7f42b053de295703a57caeabf67d6426f9eab111f289ada6c50f4acd4348067","durationMs":14400,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3729],[3729,6092],[6092,8898],[8898,14400]],"words":[[0,738],[738,1477],[1477,2215],[2215,2400],[2400,3729],[3729,4763],[4763,6092],[6092,6277],[6277,7200],[7200,7938],[7938,8898],[8898,9822],[9822,10560],[10560,10929],[10929,12222],[12222,13255],[13255,14400]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Then Buzz saw one yellow flower. One! She landed on it. It had sweet juice inside. It is called nectar.","sentences":["Then Buzz saw one yellow flower.","One!","She landed on it.","It had sweet juice inside.","It is called nectar."],"alt":"A bee lands on one yellow flower.","image":{"hash":"sha256:c51a5a6eb61c66138ff63ed1ed2c1579dd9da8e3c4080ac6446d577fa26da74c","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:f687b33a549a091a9f4385f46839ef28df3724041c0cd26ed69f1c232f902457","durationMs":16000,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4918],[4918,5962],[5962,8691],[8691,12766],[12766,16000]],"words":[[0,674],[674,1347],[1347,1853],[1853,2358],[2358,3368],[3368,4918],[4918,5962],[5962,6467],[6467,7478],[7478,7815],[7815,8691],[8691,9027],[9027,9533],[9533,10375],[10375,11217],[11217,12766],[12766,13103],[13103,13440],[13440,14451],[14451,16000]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Yellow dust stuck to her legs. It is called pollen. Buzz flew to the next flower. Two! The pollen fell off. That helps flowers make seeds.","sentences":["Yellow dust stuck to her legs.","It is called pollen.","Buzz flew to the next flower.","Two!","The pollen fell off.","That helps flowers make seeds."],"alt":"A bee with yellow dust on her legs lands on a second flower.","image":{"hash":"sha256:064defea69557e189e636b8cfb6bbba4698cb3a54ca464d8aec526d8d6fc3ac0","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e10c8ad443f465645f791996762be76ea44e541aed82467d9ff9505755c60d09","durationMs":17200,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3707],[3707,6324],[6324,9895],[9895,10740],[10740,13357],[13357,17200]],"words":[[0,818],[818,1363],[1363,2044],[2044,2317],[2317,2726],[2726,3707],[3707,3980],[3980,4252],[4252,5070],[5070,6324],[6324,6869],[6869,7414],[7414,7687],[7687,8096],[8096,8641],[8641,9895],[9895,10740],[10740,11149],[11149,11966],[11966,12512],[12512,13357],[13357,13902],[13902,14583],[14583,15537],[15537,16082],[16082,17200]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"A girl named Afi saw Buzz. ‘Bees like flowers,’ she said. ‘I will plant more!’ She put seeds in the soil.","sentences":["A girl named Afi saw Buzz.","‘Bees like flowers,’ she said.","‘I will plant more!’ She put seeds in the soil."],"alt":"A girl plants seeds in soil beside a bee.","image":{"hash":"sha256:bc0c450e4cd0b361a177b3b807d17c3d3b7ddda1f42696314d3f6ef6356ad2f7","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:2c0f31f7fea994321c4651161c7f0d57df8745de268bd13b3be9263503367f41","durationMs":13360,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3429],[3429,7389],[7389,13360]],"words":[[0,148],[148,739],[739,1478],[1478,1921],[1921,2365],[2365,3429],[3429,4020],[4020,4611],[4611,5882],[5882,6325],[6325,7389],[7389,7537],[7537,8128],[8128,8867],[8867,9931],[9931,10375],[10375,10818],[10818,11557],[11557,11853],[11853,12296],[12296,13360]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Afi gave the seeds water. Soon there were three, four, five flowers! Buzz went from flower to flower.","sentences":["Afi gave the seeds water.","Soon there were three, four, five flowers!","Buzz went from flower to flower."],"alt":"A girl waters a row of five flowers while a bee hovers.","image":{"hash":"sha256:94befe27d7b5774efc20e349df6b7ce6a468cd6b4699053fccb7ed4df681fca9","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:5f3852f32792127e39828597298405c8307d7deff284e0f004f027fcfae93d8e","durationMs":16080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4064],[4064,10965],[10965,16080]],"words":[[0,525],[525,1226],[1226,1752],[1752,2627],[2627,4064],[4064,4764],[4764,5640],[5640,6341],[6341,7497],[7497,8478],[8478,9179],[9179,10965],[10965,11666],[11666,12367],[12367,13067],[13067,14118],[14118,14468],[14468,16080]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Buzz was not hungry any more. Zzz, zzz, zzz! She hummed a happy song. The end.","sentences":["Buzz was not hungry any more.","Zzz, zzz, zzz!","She hummed a happy song.","The end."],"alt":"A happy bee rests on a flower in the sun.","image":{"hash":"sha256:12f4f0929918eefcdd0c756a79de4c26239ddbe9987382f890df653ec3268fb5","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:98e2ed1348b3c6d6d2a5ccddad3a6034f5dfeb129f0142a7bc240642946f5ba9","durationMs":14800,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5312],[5312,8434],[8434,12935],[12935,14800]],"words":[[0,811],[811,1419],[1419,2027],[2027,3244],[3244,3852],[3852,5312],[5312,6244],[6244,7177],[7177,8434],[8434,9042],[9042,10259],[10259,10461],[10461,11475],[11475,12935],[12935,13543],[13543,14800]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"buzz-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":1,"question":"What was the bee called?","options":["Buzz","Afi","Honk"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"buzz-p1","type":"prediction","afterPage":3,"prompt":"Buzz is hungry. What does she want to find? Tell a friend.","options":["Flowers","A truck"]},{"id":"buzz-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":6,"targetSound":"b","prompt":"Which words start with the b sound, like Buzz?","options":["bee","flower","bare","sun"],"correctIndexes":[0,2]},{"id":"buzz-s1","type":"sequencing","prompt":"Put the story in order.","items":["Buzz was hungry.","Buzz found one flower.","Afi planted more flowers."]},{"id":"buzz-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Afi planted flowers to help the bee. How do you feel when you help?","feelingOptions":["Kind","Happy","Proud","Sleepy"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"nectar","definition":"The sweet juice inside a flower.","pages":[4]},{"word":"pollen","definition":"Yellow dust inside a flower that helps it make seeds.","pages":[5]},{"word":"hungry","definition":"Wanting to eat.","pages":[1]}],"assets":{"sha256:f3019db075b36552f4e0b963bc4f23d486264353e44f5bcf4fcbcb9cf60fae71":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page1-1.webp","bytes":96236,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:6bd3c192e0d431b9b50c77216eb59cdac981818e7491f1bd9367c8926934eeb5":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/6bd3c192e0d4.mp3","bytes":111980,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:08340df610bdbddb2423dc7d91065224b941d38668a33e4a7090fcefdf8eb965":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page2-1.webp","bytes":65010,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:198bdb55e06b57966ca1e3eed16bb6dc755f4ac7eaa890585976139398005883":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/198bdb55e06b.mp3","bytes":126380,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:e5db8f9d1313bfebd24b44a28172cbdd7efbbb093f2055b008c6dcac5bbd7e10":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page3-1.webp","bytes":111508,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:c7f42b053de295703a57caeabf67d6426f9eab111f289ada6c50f4acd4348067":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/c7f42b053de2.mp3","bytes":115820,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:c51a5a6eb61c66138ff63ed1ed2c1579dd9da8e3c4080ac6446d577fa26da74c":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page4-1.webp","bytes":62968,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:f687b33a549a091a9f4385f46839ef28df3724041c0cd26ed69f1c232f902457":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/f687b33a549a.mp3","bytes":128684,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:064defea69557e189e636b8cfb6bbba4698cb3a54ca464d8aec526d8d6fc3ac0":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page5-1.webp","bytes":66290,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:e10c8ad443f465645f791996762be76ea44e541aed82467d9ff9505755c60d09":{"